#tr.en: Nu(ṭ)ṭuptum, daughter of Ṣi(l)li-šamaš,
4. ama-ar-gi4-ni in-gar 
#tr.en: has set free (and)
5. sag-ki-ni in-dadag 
#tr.en: her forehead has cleansed;
6. dug nam-geme2-ni-sze3 in-gaz 
#tr.en: she has freed her from slavery (lit. she has broken the jar of her slavery).
